('PEPGaoZhong_10','PEPGaoZhong_10_95','whichever','wɪtʃ''ɛvɚ','wɪtʃ''evə','[pron] 无论哪一个，任何','It will be a difficult operation, whichever method you choose.  不管你选择哪种方法，手术都会很复杂。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_10','PEPGaoZhong_10_96','darling','''dɑrlɪŋ','''dɑːlɪŋ','[n] 心爱的人; [adj] 亲爱的，可爱的','Look, darling, there’s Mary.  看呀，亲爱的，玛丽来了。'),
