('Level8_1','Level8_1_107','dialectical',',daɪə''lɛktɪkl','ˌdaɪə''lektɪkl','[adj] 方言的，辩证的','The essence of dialectical thought is division.  辩证思想的实质是二分法。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_108','namely','''nemli','ˈneɪmli','[adv] 即，也就是说','Three students were mentioned, namely John, Sarah and Sylvia.  有三名学生被提到，即约翰、萨拉和西尔维娅。'),
