('Level8_1','Level8_1_112','synch','siŋk','sɪŋk','[v] 同时发生，同步','By using a Recovery Protocol, we can stay in synch with our overall vision, values, and goals during the rough times.  通过利用恢复协议，在艰难时期，我们可以与我们整个的视界、价值和目标保持同步。'),
