('Level8_1','Level8_1_140','steadfastness','','''stedfa:stnis','[n] 坚定不移','For that steadfastness and courage, he''ll always be our hero.  由于他的坚定和勇敢，他将是我们永远的英雄。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_141','tenacity','tə''næsɪti','''stedfa:stnis','[n] 固执；不屈不挠','Talent, hard work and sheer tenacity are all crucial to career success.  才能、勤奋和百分之百的执著对事业成功都是至关重要的。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_142','stubbornly','''stʌbɚnli','''stʌbɚnli','[adv] 固执地','And for those who stubbornly suggest pricing above what I believe the market will bear, I say ''best of luck to you.  对于那些顽固地要求比我认为市场能承受的更高的价码的卖主，我会说上一句：“祝您好运”。'),
