('Level8_1','Level8_1_171','corridor','''kɔrɪdɔr','''kɒrɪdɔː','[n] 走廊','Go down here and the bathroom’s at the end of the corridor.  沿着这儿走，浴室就在走廊的尽头。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_172','habitat','''hæbə''tæt','''hæbɪtæt','[n] 栖息地','watching monkeys in their natural habitat  观察自然生活环境中的猴子'),
