('Level8_1','Level8_1_174','multiple','''mʌltəpl','''mʌltɪpl','[adj] 许多的，多重的','Baxter was rushed to the hospital with multiple stab wounds.  巴克斯特因多处刺伤被紧急送往医院。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_175','spatial','''speʃl','''speɪʃ(ə)l','[adj] 空间的','...the spatial distribution of black employment and population in South Africa.  …南非黑人就业和人口的空间分布。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_176','megacity','','''megəsɪtɪ','[n] 大城市（人口超过1000万）','In the competition between the megacity and the holy city, Upadhyay says, "Delhi is winning, of course.  大城市和圣城的的较量中，阿帕德海耶说：“当然是德里赢了。”'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_177','temperate','''tɛmpərət','''temp(ə)rət','[adj] 温和的','The Nile Valley keeps a temperate climate throughout the year.  尼罗河流域全年气候温和。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_178','arid','''ærɪd','''ærɪd','[adj] 干旱的','Water from the Great Lakes is pumped to arid regions .  五大湖中的水被输往干旱地区。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_179','compromise','''kɑmprəmaɪz','''kɒmprəmaɪz','[n&v] 危害；妥协','Compromise is an inevitable part of marriage.  妥协是婚姻生活中必不可少的。'),
