('Level8_1','Level8_1_181','homogenize','ho''mɑdʒə,naɪz','hə''mɒdʒənaɪz','[v] 使类同，使一致','plans to homogenize the various school systems  统一各类不同学制的计划'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_182','aesthetic','ɛs''θɛtɪk','iːs''θetɪk','[n&adj] 美学的，审美的','From an esthetic point of view, it’s a nice design.  从美学角度看，这是个不错的设计。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_183','portable','''pɔrtəbl','''pɔːtəb(ə)l','[adj] 便携的，手提的','a portable radio  便携式收音机'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_184','envision','ɪn''vɪʒn','ɪnˈvɪʒn','[v] 展望，预想','I envisioned a future of educational excellence.  我展望了一个有着优质教育的未来。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_185','incorporate','','ɪn''kɔːpəreɪt','[v] 合并；体现','It allows you to harness existing technologies and incorporate them into one application.  它允许您利用现有的技术并将它们合并到同一个应用程序中。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_186','heritage','''hɛrɪtɪdʒ','''herɪtɪdʒ','[n] 遗产','the importance of preserving the national heritage  保护民族遗产的重要性'),
