('Level8_1','Level8_1_193','outraged','''autreidʒid','''autreidʒid','[adj] 暴怒的','Every few months, I receive an e-mail from an outraged (usually white) reader who is dismayed by what she sees as the denigration of my work.  每隔几个月，我便会收到一封来自愤怒读者（通常是白人）的电子邮件，对于她认为我的作品遭到的诋毁感到愤忾。'),
