('Level8_1','Level8_1_204','propensity','prə''pɛnsəti','prəu''pensiti','[n] 倾向','Mr. Bint has a propensity to put off decisions to the last minute.  宾特先生有一种将决定拖到最后一分钟的倾向。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_205','gratification',',ɡrætɪfɪ''keʃən','ɡrætɪfɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 满足','So even to-day, when we fail to see the truth of religion, we seek in its observance an artistic gratification.  所以，甚至在今天，在我们还看不到宗教的真理时，我们只能从宗教的仪式里去寻求艺术的满足。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_206','arrogant','''ærəɡənt','''ærəg(ə)nt','[adj] 傲慢无礼的','He was unbearably arrogant.  他的傲慢让人无法忍受。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_207','irritable','''ɪrɪtəbl','''ɪrɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 易怒的','Jo was tired, irritable, and depressed.  乔疲惫暴躁，而且情绪低落。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_208','pinched','pɪntʃt','pɪntʃt','[adj] 憔悴的','She had a small pinched face with sad eyes.  她瘦小的脸庞面容憔悴，眼神悲伤。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_209','proximity','prɑk''sɪməti','prɒk''sɪmɪtɪ','[n] 接近','Here the rich and the poor live in close proximity (= very near to each other ) .  在这里，富人和穷人比邻而居。'),
('Level8_1','Level8_1_210','pedantic','pɪ''dæntɪk','pɪ''dæntɪk','[adj] 学究式的','His lecture was so pedantic and uninteresting.  他的讲座学究气十足且没趣。'),
