('SAT_3','SAT_3_807','transformer','træns''fɔrmɚ','træns''fɔːmə','[n] 变压器','Keep away from the transformer.  不要靠近那个变压器。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_808','presage','''prɛsɪdʒ','''presidʒ','[v] 预示； 预知','The large number of moderate earthquakes that have occurred recently could presage a larger quake soon.  最近多次发生中等强度的地震，这预示着可能很快就会发生更强烈的地震。'),
