('SAT_3','SAT_3_841','recombination','ri''kɑmbə''neʃən','riːˌkɔmbə''neiʃən','[n] 重组','The reform with recombination can improve the whole benefit of the state enterprise .  改革与重组能提高国有企业的整体效益。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_842','dearth','də:θ','dəːθ','[n] 缺乏','EXCEPT as Pearl, in the dearth of human playmates, was thrown more upon the visionary throng which she created.  只不过是由于缺乏玩伴，她同自己创造出来的幻想中的人群更加接近而己。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_843','commit','kə''mɪt','kə''mit','[v] 把…交托给， 提交； 犯 ， 干','Women commit fewer crimes than men.  女性犯罪比男性少。'),
