('SAT_3','SAT_3_1285','rancor','''ræŋkə','''ræŋkə','[n] 深仇， 怨恨','He has no rancor at heart against you .  他心中对你并无怨恨。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1286','explode','ɪk''splod','ik''spləud','[v] 爆炸，  爆发','The device was thrown at an army patrol but failed to explode.  炸弹投向了陆军巡逻队，但没有爆炸。'),
