('SAT_3','SAT_3_1836','proverb','''prɑvɝb','''prɔvəːb','[n] 谚语','An old Arab proverb says, "The enemy of my enemy is my friend."  有一句古老的阿拉伯谚语说：“我敌人的敌人是我的朋友。”'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1837','tangential','tæn''dʒɛnʃl','tæn''dʒenʃəl','[adj] 切线的','He closed his office on the street tangential to the courthouse square and walked the two blocks to his house..  他关了与法院广场相切的那条街上的办公室门，走过了两条街回到家。'),
