('SAT_3','SAT_3_1873','context','''kɑntɛkst','''kɔntekst','[n] 上下文， 文章前后关系','The meaning of ‘mad’ depends on its context. mad  一词的意义要视上下文而定。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1874','abidance','ə''baɪdns','ə''baidəns','[n] 居住； 遵守','The coach demanded abidance by the rules of the game.  教授指示他的学生要遵守实验规则。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1875','augur','''ɔgɚ','''ɔːgə','[v] 占卜， 预言; [n] 占兆官；占卜师，预言者','The renewed violence this week hardly augurs well for smooth or peaceful change.  本周新的暴力事件预示着顺利的平稳转变几乎是不可能的。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1876','advisory','əd''vaɪzəri','əd''vaizəri','[adj] 咨询的； 劝告的','...members of the advisory committee on the safety of nuclear installations.  …核设施安全咨询委员会的成员们。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1877','issue','''ɪʃu','''iʃjuː','[v] 流出，放出；发行，发表，颁布; [n] 发行 ，  期号； 问题， 争论点， 争端','Silva issued a statement denying all knowledge of the affair.  西尔瓦发表声明，宣称对此事一无所知。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1878','pundit','''pʌndɪt','''pʌndit','[n] 博学者','In cases like this, when every pundit is calling for a crash, I try to step back and look at history.  像这样的情况，当所有的学者名人都出言呼吁破产的时候，我试着退一步看看历史。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1879','lingual','''lɪŋɡwəl','''liŋgwəl','[adj] 语言的','He''s multi-lingual. Angel is a speaker of English, Russian, Arab and French. And love.  安吉尔说多种语言：英语、俄语、阿拉伯语和法语，当然他也懂爱的语言。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1880','subsistence','səb''sɪstəns','səb''sistəns','[n] 生存； 生活','Many of the families are forced to live at the subsistence level.  很多家庭被迫生活在基本生活水准线上。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1881','dejected','dɪ''dʒɛktɪd','di''dʒektid','[adj] 沮丧的， 灰心的','The unemployed stood at street corners, dejected.  失业者沮丧地站在街角。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1882','metal','''mɛtl','''metəl','[n] 金属','The gate is made of metal.  这扇大门是用金属做成的。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1883','audacity','ɔ''dæsəti','ɔː''dæsəti','[n] 大胆， 厚颜','I can’t believe he had the audacity to ask me for more money!  我真不敢相信，他竟胆敢还向我要钱！'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1884','autarchy','''ɔtɑrki','''ɔːtɑːki','[n] 独裁； 专制','Nowadays many scholars think that the may4th culture conservatism serves for the idea of feudalism returning of the ancients and autarchy culture.  在当今学术界，许多学者对五四文化保守主义持批判的态度，认定其是为封建复古主义和专制文化服务的。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1885','germination',',dʒɝmə''neʃən','ˌdʒəːmi''neiʃən','[n] 发芽','To study germination characteristics of Mirabilis jalapa and Althaea rosea by soaking their dormant seeds.  摘要对紫茉莉和蜀葵休眠种子浸种处理研究其发芽特性。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1886','habitable','''hæbɪtəbl','''hæbitəbl','[adj] 可居住的','It would cost a fortune to make the place habitable.  要想让这个地方可以住人得花一大笔钱。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1887','malign','mə''laɪn','mə''lain','[v] 诽谤; [adj] 恶毒的','She had seen herself repeatedly maligned in the newspapers.  她看到自己在报纸上一再受到诽谤。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1888','plaintive','''plentɪv','''pleintiv','[adj] 悲哀的， 哀伤的','They lay on the firm sands, listening to the plaintive cry of the seagulls.  他们躺在坚实的沙滩上，听着海鸥的哀鸣。'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1889','lively','''laɪvli','''laivli','[adj] 活泼的， 活跃的','a lively child  精力充沛的孩子'),
('SAT_3','SAT_3_1890','malleable','''mælɪəbl','''mæliəbl','[adj] 有延展性的， 可锻的； 易受影响的， 能根据环境的变化而调整的， 适应的','malleable steel  展性钢'),
