('GRE_2','GRE_2_2289','mucilage','''mjʊsəlɪdʒ','''mjuːsɪlɪdʒ','[n] (植物的)黏液, 胶水','They tested two types of mucilage — a gelatinous substance produced by the cactus — in contaminated water.  他们在被污染的水中测试了两种粘液——仙人掌分泌的胶状物质。'),
