('GRE_2','GRE_2_2292','seneschal','''sɛnɪfəl','''senɪʃ(ə)l','[n] (中世纪贵族城堡中)管家','Only he, as seneschal, was granted that privilege, particularly while the master lay ill.  只有他，作为总管，赋有这特权，特别是当总领病卧在床。'),
