('GRE_2','GRE_2_2308','isthmus','''ɪsməs','''ɪsθməs; ''ɪstməs; ''ɪsməs','[n] [地理]地峡, 峡部','the Isthmus of Panama  巴拿马地峡'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_2309','gneiss','naɪs','naɪs','[n] [地质]片麻岩','Baby, you''re so gneiss I''ll never take you for granite.  宝贝，你是如此的片麻岩，我永远不会把你当花岗岩的。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_2310','anode','''ænod','''ænəʊd','[n] [电]阳极, 正极','So the left electrode will be the cathode as I have configured it, and the right electrode will be anode.  因此左边电极就成了阴极,正如我原来设定的一样，右边的电极就是阳极。'),
