('GRE_2','GRE_2_2322','porcupine','''pɔrkjə''paɪn','''pɔːkjʊpaɪn','[n] [动]豪猪, 箭猪','In Maine, the most commonly counted roadkill species is the North American porcupine.  在缅因州，公路交通事故中杀死的动物种类是北美箭猪。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_2323','locust','''lokəst','''ləʊkəst','[n] [动]蝗虫, 蚱蜢, 蝉','a swarm of locusts  一大群蝗虫'),
