('GRE_2','GRE_2_2344','calcium','''kælsɪəm','''kælsɪəm','[n] [化]钙(元素符号Ca)','Like fibre, calcium binds with fat molecules and helps flush them out through the intestine.  像纤维、钙可以和脂肪分子结合，帮助他们彻底的通过肠道。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_2345','alkali','''ælkə''lai','''ælkəlaɪ','[n] [化]碱','The extremely salty, alkali lake holds little life, but its waters are a favorite spot for wading birds.  其味极咸，碱湖保存了湖中的小生命，但其水域仍为涉水鸟所喜欢的地方。'),
