('GRE_2','GRE_2_2975','rhubarb','''rʊbɑrb','''ruːbɑːb','[n] 大黄, 大黄的叶柄','From the low-growing Indian rhubarb to the mighty English maples, the plants in this region get ready for the winter with a cornucopia of colors.  从低速度生长的印度大黄到巨大的英国枫树，这一地区的植物用丰富的色彩为冬天的到来做好准备。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_2976','holocaust','''hɑləkɔst','''hɒləkɔːst','[n] 大毁灭, 大屠杀','A nuclear holocaust seemed a very real possibility in the ''50s.  在50年代，核灾难似乎是件很有可能发生的事。'),
