('GRE_2','GRE_2_3122','unicorn','''junɪkɔrn','''juːnɪkɔːn','[n] 独角兽, 麒麟','The reason there are so few unicorn sightings today isn''t because they are mythical creatures that never existed, but because of modern society''s moral depravity.  这些年很少有人见到独角兽，这并非因为那都是童话，现实里压根就不存在什么的。 而是现代社会人心不古，道德沦丧。'),
