('GRE_2','GRE_2_3516','concord','''kɑŋkɔrd','''kɒŋkɔːd','[n] 和谐, 一致, 和睦','They expressed the hope that he would pursue a neutral and balanced policy for the sake of national concord.  他们希望他能为国家的和谐而追求一种中立而平衡的政策。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3517','estuary','''ɛstʃʊ''ɛri','''estjʊ(ə)rɪ','[n] 河口, 江口','the Thames estuary  泰晤士河河口'),
