('GRE_2','GRE_2_3544','gourd','ɡʊrd','gʊəd; gɔːd','[n] 葫芦','I refused the last but washed down the fruit and vegetables with clear, cold water from a hollowed gourd.  我没有动第三碗，只就着一只葫芦里干净的凉水，把水果和蔬菜风卷残云地吃了下去。'),
